った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">古老的冰箱是可怕的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">忠告</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅうこく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">劝告；忠告；警告</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"154195\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>煙草<rp>(</rp><rt>たばこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>吸<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うなと<ruby>忠告<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゅうこく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我建议他不要吸烟。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">中国</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅうごく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">中国</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n5/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">中</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">中止</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅうし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">中断；中止；暂停；停止；取消（预定活动）；撤销</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"82499\"><ruby>暴風雨<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼうふうう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のため<ruby>道路工事<rp>(</rp><rt>どうろこうじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>中止<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゅうし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">由于暴风雨,道路建设被暂停。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">注射</sp