/rp><rt>こうえん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">市中心有一个美丽的公园。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">忠実</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅうじつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">忠实；忠诚；忠贞；诚实；真实</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230445\">あの<ruby>翻訳<rp>(</rp><rt>ほんやく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>原文<rp>(</rp><rt>げんぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>忠実<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゅうじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だそうだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个翻译对原文是忠实的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">中旬</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅうじゅん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">月中旬；每月11日至20日</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">中枢</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅうすう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">中枢；中心；核心；支柱；关键人物；中枢神经系统</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124211\"><ruby>東京<rp>(</rp><rt>とうきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>や<ruby>世界経済<rp>(</rp><rt>せかいけいざい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>中枢<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゅうすう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">东京现在是世界经济的中心。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">中世</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang